## characters mean; "_" is darkness beyond the arena, so an arena can be any shape).
## One is chosen at random each time a match starts (Network._do_start), and the
## choice is sent to everyone, so all players load the same one. To add an arena:
## add its rows below, list it in MAPS, then bake its picture (README: "the map").
## Each needs at least 5 "S" spawns and at least 3 each of "1" and "2".

